but I could see Guardian or Liminal replacing Creator. I definitely agree about the Tattoos. He's also called Demigod of the Sea and Sky...</div> </div> </div> </div>True but you can be a lower case warrior without having the upper case Warrior calling. I'm not saying he wouldn't in a Scion based universe but his depiction in the film made it seem like fighting was mostly something that happened when trickery failed. Most of the feats he bragged about in &quot;your Welcome&quot; weren't so much &quot;I beat this scary thing&quot; as &quot;Remember that cool thing I found for you?&quot;. Not saying all Warriors in the game sense are mindless thugs but I would say goal is the key thing here. The difference between a skill and a lifestyle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8375-vonpenguin","name":"vonpenguin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T03:12:15-08:00","id":1019144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>unnatural1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1007565-moana?p=1013593#post1013593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I saw it on Sunday, and it was AWESOME!<br /> <br /> \u200bSo, Maui? I'm thinking Warrior, Trickster, Creator? Purviews: Epic Strength, Animal (All), and maybe War?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know Polynesian myths in Depths but I believe he had specific animal shapes, plants, and natural objects, rather then just giving him Animal All. So he was a shapeshifter, but so was Loki and we don't give him Animal All. I don't think War is something we would just tack on because he is a warrior. So maybe Strength and Chaos, he was more a Cultural Hero then a full god. He did a lot of cool stuff, but he wasn't really the Master of so many domains. I don't know supermuch about how 2nd ed does archtypes so I don't know how Creator works, he caused a lot of things to be Created but isn't that for Gods that shaped humanity, animals and the World?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-10T14:59:27-08:00","id":1046933,"title":"","content":"All I know is now I want to make a Scion who forces people to sing like they are in a musical. The scene in &quot;You're Welcome&quot; made me extremely happy and felt like it belonged in a purview or Legendary Charisma Knack <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12984-harp0","name":"Harp0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12984_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-10T15:20:34-08:00","id":1046947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Harp0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1007565-moana?p=1046933#post1046933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All I know is now I want to make a Scion who forces people to sing like they are in a musical. The scene in &quot;You're Welcome&quot; made me extremely happy and felt like it belonged in a purview or Legendary Charisma Knack <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>If &quot;Convince people to play along with you due to illusions&quot; isn't a Trickster Knack I'll be sad.<br /> <br /> Plus, there IS an Artistry purview that I imagine that Singing will fall under.<br /> <br /> There won't be Epic Charisma knacks since Knacks are being used by Callings, and the Epic Attributes are A. Limited to the Physicals (Strength, Dex, Stamina) and B. Purviews now.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-11T00:27:42-08:00","id":1047103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1007565-moana?p=1046947#post1046947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If &quot;Convince people to play along with you due to illusions&quot; isn't a Trickster Knack I'll be sad.<br /> <br /> Plus, there IS an Artistry purview that I imagine that Singing will fall under.<br /> <br /> There won't be Epic Charisma knacks since Knacks are being used by Callings, and the Epic Attributes are A. Limited to the Physicals (Strength, Dex, Stamina) and B. Purviews now.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI'm almost certain that'll fall under the Deception purview. Or maybe you could pull it off with Artistry (Music).<br /> <br /> \u200bEDIT: Now we know more about the Artistry purview, it was probably a Deception miracle used with an Artistry (Music) motif. He sang, and the illusions happened. You could too!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12689,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12689-creepyshutin","user":"CreepyShutIn","date":". 03-03-2017, 04:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12689-creepyshutin","name":"CreepyShutIn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}